{"title":"PRODUCTS","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-sheets-root=\"1\"\u003eWelcome to the Datum Dahleez Store, your ultimate destination for unparalleled luxury across a diverse range of meticulously crafted products. Our collection encompasses exquisite eyewear, cutting-edge tech, stunning model cars, sophisticated clothing, elegant accessories, and an exclusive lifestyle selection, each embodying the essence of Datum Dahleez's commitment to opulence and precision. Every item is designed for those who appreciate the finer things in life, merging high-performance aesthetics with superior craftsmanship. Explore our curated offerings, where each product signifies not just style, but a lifestyle of exclusivity and authenticity. Elevate your everyday experience with Datum Dahleez’s signature elegance and innovation.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-e-scooter-10-max-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez E-SCOOTER 10\" MAX BLUE","description":"\u003cp\u003eIntroducing the Datum Dahleez E-Scooter 10\" Max, designed to enhance daily urban mobility and offer consumers a taste of Datum Dahleez's unwavering dedication to top-tier design and state-of-the-art technology.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344081592667,"sku":"BG-EU-10-501-AB","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/e39_1_f074610d-085e-47aa-b7e7-0afd73f9e0db.jpg?v=1742416441"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-e-scooter-10-max-black","title":"Datum Dahleez E-SCOOTER 10\" MAX BLACK","description":"\u003cp\u003eIntroducing the Datum Dahleez E-Scooter 10\" Max, designed to enhance daily urban mobility and offer consumers a taste of Datum Dahleez's unwavering dedication to top-tier design and state-of-the-art technology.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","