z's heritage and commitment to unparalleled craftsmanship. Made from 85% organic cotton and 15% polyester.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eMale model is wearing: L (Model height: 6’1”)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp id=\"EDHKATD\"\u003eFemale model is wearing: M (Model height: 5’8”)\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"XS","offer_id":49344103121243,"sku":"BU124U102GR1S","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"S","offer_id":49344103154011,"sku":"BU124U102GR0S","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"M","offer_id":49344103186779,"sku":"BU124U102GR0M","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"L","offer_id":49344103219547,"sku":"BU124U102GR0L","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false},{"title":"XL","offer_id":49344103252315,"sku":"BU124U102GR1L","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false},{"title":"XXL","offer_id":49344103285083,"sku":"BU124U102GR2L","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false},{"title":"XXXL","offer_id":49344103317851,"sku":"BU124U102GR3L","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/w16-logo-sweatshirt-grey-Final_15.jpg?v=1764251261"},{"product_id":"logo-graphic-oversized-sweatshirt","title":"LOGO GRAPHIC OVERSIZED SWEATSHIRT","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThis cream, long-sleeved sweatshirt showcases the iconic Datum Dahleez emblem on the front and Ettore Datum Dahleez’s legendary quote on the back, embodying the brand's legacy. The sweatshirt effortlessly blends fashion and automotive sophistication for Datum Dahleez enthusiasts everywhere. Made from 85% organic cotton and 15% polyester.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eMale model is wearing: L (Model height: 6’0”)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp id=\"EDHKATD\"\u003eFemale model is wearing: M (Model height: 5’8”)\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"XS","offer_id":49344104595803,"sku":"BU124U101BG1S","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"S","offer_id":49344104628571,"sku":"BU124U101BG0S","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"M","offer_id":49344104661339,"sku":"BU124U101BG0M","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false},{"title":"L","offer_id":49344104694107,"sku":"BU124U101BG0L","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false},{"title":"XL","offer_id":49344104726875,"sku":"BU124U101BG1L","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"XXL","offer_id":49344104759643,"sku":"BU124U101BG2L","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"XXXL","offer_id":49344104792411,"sku":"BU124U101BG3L","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/cream-long-sleeved-sweatshirt-Datum Dahleez-print-front.jpg?v=1764250097"},{"product_id":"abstract-graphic-t-shirt","title":"ABSTRACT GRAPHIC T-SHIRT","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThis black, short-sleeved t-shirt boasts the iconic Datum Dahleez logo on the front, while the back features a striking large abstract graphic and slogan. Made from 100% organic cotton, it's a sleek choice for automotive enthusiasts everywhere.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eMale model is wearing: M (Model height: 6’0”)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp id=\"EDHKATD\"\u003eFemale model is wearing: M (Model height: 5’8”)\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"XS","offer_id":49344105316699,"sku":"BU124U007BK1S","price":90.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"S","offer_id":49344105349467,"sku":"BU124U007BK0S","price":90.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"M","offer_id":49344105382235,"sku":"BU124U007BK0M","price":90.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false},{"title":"L","offer_id":49344105415003,"sku":"BU124U007BK0L","price":90.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false},{"title":"XL","offer_id":49344105447771,"sku":"BU124U007BK1L","price":90.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"XXL","offer_id":49344105480539,"sku":"BU124U007BK2L","price":90.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false},{"title":"XXXL","offer_id":49344105513307,"sku":"BU124U007BK3L","price":90.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/black-short-sleeved-t-shirt-Datum Dahleez-logo.jpg?v=1764249354"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-baby-ii-tourbillon-edition","title":"Datum Dahleez BABY II TOURBILLON EDITION","description":"\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Baby II is a 75% scale, fully electric reimagination of the iconic Datum Dahleez Type 35, developed using a full 3D scan of an original 1924 French Grand Prix car. As an official Datum Dahleez product, only components of the highest quality have been used, with each car being impeccably hand-built. The Baby II is adorned with a genuine, solid silver Datum Dahleez Macaron, a symbol of exclusivity, luxury and craftsmanship that has stood for over 110 years. A true continuation of a prestigious history.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003eJust like the original, the Datum Dahleez Baby II is a strictly limited edition with only 500 models being built. The Baby II top speed reaches 68KPH depending on territory, and has a range of up to 100km.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003eThe Baby II can be customised to your preference with the wide range of exterior paint finishes and interior leather trims available. It is available in two variants, the 'Vitesse' with a carbon fibre body, and the 'Pur Sang' with a hand-formed aluminium body.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003ePlease note while they can be built to order, there are also a few stock models available for immediate delivery. Please contact our Customer Care team for any enquires.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344107807067,"sku":"1293","price":65000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/06datum dahleezBabydatum dahleezTourbillonEdition.jpg?v=1781703443"},{"product_id":"wireless-active-noise-cancelling-headphones-in-nocturne-and-lake-blue","title":"WIRELESS ACTIVE NOISE CANCELLING HEADPHONES IN NOCTURNE \u0026 LAKE BLUE","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Wireless Headphones offer a blend of functionality and style, in a lightweight anodized aluminium, durable tempered glass, and soft lambskin leather promote longer wear in a sleek, luxurious finish. Boasting replaceable memory foam ear pads and a felted hard shell travel case to provide additional comfort and protection on-the-go. With angled ear cups fine-tuned for an even wider soundstage, the custom 40mm Beryllium coated drivers evenly distribute our expansive, signature sound in the form of warmer lows and richer highs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eAdaptive Active Noise Cancelling automatically adjusts the level of noise cancellation to match your surroundings, leaving behind nothing but the sound you want. Enjoy up to 32 hours of total battery life or up to 28 hours with Active Noise Cancellation enabled. For optimal battery usage, proximity sensors allow for on-head detection to auto-pause your Datum Dahleez Wireless Headphones, so you get the most out of your listening time.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344110297435,"sku":"MW75BGT2","price":750.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/a5_cc75c4f5-525e-4b20-bde7-abff9432682f.jpg?v=1742416376"},{"product_id":"jacob-and-co-x-Datum Dahleez-chiron-tourbillon-luxury-watch-diamond","title":"JACOB \u0026 CO X Datum Dahleez CHIRON TOURBILLON LUXURY WATCH - DIAMOND","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Chiron Tourbillon timepiece has done something no one has ever even attempted before - to seamlessly marry engines and watches.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Chiron Tourbillon features a 30º inclined tourbillon, the first time Jacob \u0026amp; Co. has ever used an inclined tourbillon. The \"flying\" part of the tourbillon means that the regulating organ is only supported on one side, so the tourbillon is even more mesmerizing. \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe crankshaft turns and the 16 pistons pump up and down, just like a true internal combustion engine. Two \"turbochargers\" (down from four in the actual Chiron engine) on the side of the engine block spin while the engine runs, adding to the visual impact.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe power reserve for the animation and the power reserve for timekeeping are different, yet both are wound through the winding crown, clockwise for the movement, counterclockwise for the engine animation. The power reserve indication even has the universal gas pump symbol on the side of the gauge at nine o'clock.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAvailable in bespoke colour ways including rose gold, titanium, white ceramic, sapphire crystal, pave, etc. Please submit an enquiry form and the Jacob \u0026amp; Co customer care team will be in contact to discuss all available options.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344111247707,"sku":"1322","price":1500000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/jacob-co-x-Datum Dahleez-chiron-tourbillon-luxury-watch-diamond-blue.jpg?v=1773839807"},{"product_id":"jacob-and-co-x-Datum Dahleez-chiron-tourbillon-luxury-watch-sapphire","title":"JACOB \u0026 CO X Datum Dahleez CHIRON TOURBILLON LUXURY WATCH - SAPPHIRE","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Chiron Tourbillon timepiece has done something no one has ever even attempted before - to seamlessly marry engines and watches.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Chiron Tourbillon features a 30º inclined tourbillon, the first time Jacob \u0026amp; Co. has ever used an inclined tourbillon. The \"flying\" part of the tourbillon means that the regulating organ is only supported on one side, so the tourbillon is even more mesmerizing. \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe crankshaft turns and the 16 pistons pump up and down, just like a true internal combustion engine. Two \"turbochargers\" (down from four in the actual Chiron engine) on the side of the engine block spin while the engine runs, adding to the visual impact.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe power reserve for the animation and the power reserve for timekeeping are different, yet both are wound through the winding crown, clockwise for the movement, counterclockwise for the engine animation. The power reserve indication even has the universal gas pump symbol on the side of the gauge at nine o'clock.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAvailable in bespoke colour ways including rose gold, titanium, white ceramic, sapphire crystal, pave, etc. Please submit an enquiry form and the Jacob \u0026amp; Co customer care team will be in contact to discuss all available options.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344111575387,"sku":"1333","price":800000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/jacob-co-x-Datum Dahleez-chiron-tourbillon-luxury-watch-sapphire.jpg?v=1773839587"},{"product_id":"jacob-and-co-x-Datum Dahleez-chiron-tourbillon-luxury-watch","title":"JACOB \u0026 CO X Datum Dahleez CHIRON TOURBILLON LUXURY WATCH","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Chiron Tourbillon timepiece has done something no one has ever even attempted before - to seamlessly marry engines and watches.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Chiron Tourbillon features a 30º inclined tourbillon, the first time Jacob \u0026amp; Co. has ever used an inclined tourbillon. The \"flying\" part of the tourbillon means that the regulating organ is only supported on one side, so the tourbillon is even more mesmerizing. \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe crankshaft turns and the 16 pistons pump up and down, just like a true internal combustion engine. Two \"turbochargers\" (down from four in the actual Chiron engine) on the side of the engine block spin while the engine runs, adding to the visual impact.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe power reserve for the animation and the power reserve for timekeeping are different, yet both are wound through the winding crown, clockwise for the movement, counterclockwise for the engine animation. The power reserve indication even has the universal gas pump symbol on the side of the gauge at nine o'clock.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAvailable in bespoke colour ways including rose gold, titanium, white ceramic, sapphire crystal, pave, etc. Please submit an enquiry form and the Jacob \u0026amp; Co customer care team will be in contact to discuss all available options.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344112329051,"sku":"1340","price":250000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/jacob-co-x-Datum Dahleez-chiron-tourbillon-luxury-watch.jpg?v=1773839376"},{"product_id":"wireless-gaming-headphones-in-nocturne-and-jet-orange","title":"WIRELESS GAMING HEADPHONES IN NOCTURNE \u0026 JET ORANGE","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your gaming experience with the Datum Dahleez Wireless Gaming Headphones. Immerse yourself in crystal-clear audio and hear every detail with custom Beryllium drivers and exceptional acoustics with independent volume controls for mic and game so you won't miss a move. The detachable boom microphone and internal mic array provide exceptional talk quality even when the boom mic is detached, allowing for optimal communication in a sophisticated, flexible design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCrafted from premium materials, the lightweight magnesium ear cups paired with cushioned lambskin leather pads, an Alcantara®-lined inner headband for enhanced grip, and a coated canvas outer headband offer unparalleled comfort during play and a wear that only gets better with time. Plus, for longer playtime, on-head detection preserves the battery life of your wireless gaming headphones.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay online for longer and get to 50% battery life in only 30 minutes of charging. Use the low-latency adapter to eliminate audio delays and effortlessly switch between your PC and console with convenient plug and play. An optional USB-C to 3.5mm analog connection for other compatible consoles provides added versatility.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344130777435,"sku":"MG20BGT1","price":650.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/a18_22942621-1bb4-478c-b523-5bcd7fa57f71.jpg?v=1742416362"},{"product_id":"wireless-gaming-headphones-in-blanc-and-deep-blue","title":"WIRELESS GAMING HEADPHONES IN BLANC \u0026 DEEP BLUE","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your gaming experience with the Datum Dahleez Wireless Gaming Headphones. Immerse yourself in crystal-clear audio and hear every detail with custom Beryllium drivers and exceptional acoustics with independent volume controls for mic and game so you won't miss a move. The detachable boom microphone and internal mic array provide exceptional talk quality even when the boom mic is detached, allowing for optimal communication in a sophisticated, flexible design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCrafted from premium materials, the lightweight magnesium ear cups paired with cushioned lambskin leather pads, an Alcantara®-lined inner headband for enhanced grip, and a coated canvas outer headband offer unparalleled comfort during play and a wear that only gets better with time. Plus, for longer playtime, on-head detection preserves the battery life of your wireless gaming headphones.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay online for longer and get to 50% battery life in only 30 minutes of charging. Use the low-latency adapter to eliminate audio delays and effortlessly switch between your PC and console with convenient plug and play. An optional USB-C to 3.5mm analog connection for other compatible consoles provides added versatility.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344131924315,"sku":"MG20BGT3","price":650.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/a14_1_9384fcf7-1faa-4794-98e2-de4e505d173a.jpg?v=1742416360"},{"product_id":"wireless-gaming-headphones-in-nocturne-and-lake-blue","title":"WIRELESS GAMING HEADPHONES IN NOCTURNE \u0026 LAKE BLUE","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your gaming experience with the Datum Dahleez Wireless Gaming Headphones. Immerse yourself in crystal-clear audio and hear every detail with custom Beryllium drivers and exceptional acoustics with independent volume controls for mic and game so you won't miss a move. The detachable boom microphone and internal mic array provide exceptional talk quality even when the boom mic is detached, allowing for optimal communication in a sophisticated, flexible design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCrafted from premium materials, the lightweight magnesium ear cups paired with cushioned lambskin leather pads, an Alcantara®-lined inner headband for enhanced grip, and a coated canvas outer headband offer unparalleled comfort during play and a wear that only gets better with time. Plus, for longer playtime, on-head detection preserves the battery life of your wireless gaming headphones.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay online for longer and get to 50% battery life in only 30 minutes of charging. Use the low-latency adapter to eliminate audio delays and effortlessly switch between your PC and console with convenient plug and play. An optional USB-C to 3.5mm analog connection for other compatible consoles provides added versatility.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344133923163,"sku":"MG20BGT2","price":650.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/a22_1_9a1091e5-ab51-4c21-8de4-8469bbe75f91.jpg?v=1742416359"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-champagne-carbon-eb01","title":"Datum Dahleez CHAMPAGNE CARBON EB01","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe EB01 champagne is a vintage 2002 champagne created from 90% Chardonnay and 10% Pinot Noir. Blossoming floral aromas in the glass and everlasting smoothness and roundness on your pallet. A full-bodied vintage with crispy essences waltzes with lace-like bubbles in infinite whirls. The champagne unfolds a horizon of delightful green fruits and nuts, amplified by a jolting note of salty-minerality. The 750ml bottle is wrapped with Carbon Fiber. Packaging includes luxury box and free delivery all over Europe.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344147226971,"sku":"EB01","price":320.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/c13_1_cc859739-9b84-4cf5-bcd1-3dcbb2072ad3.jpg?v=1742416347"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-champagne-carbon-eb02","title":"Datum Dahleez CHAMPAGNE CARBON EB02","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe EB02 cuvée is a vintage blanc de blancs 2006 boasts robe and fine bubbles, before opening-up to a large aromatic pallet with acacia notes, hazelnuts and stone fruits. The grape variety is 100% Chardonnay Grand Cru, which can be tasted both for aperitive, during a gastronomic meal or a happy moment of life, with raw ham of Pata Negra or a delicious caviar, this cuvée pairs well with all occasions. The 750ml bottle is wrapped with Carbon Fiber. Packaging includes luxury box and free delivery all over Europe.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344149160283,"sku":"EB02","price":320.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/c5_ee7fb0ca-d3d4-4a2a-8bfe-f6fe0a1ae029.jpg?v=1742416346"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-champagne-carbon-eb03","title":"Datum Dahleez CHAMPAGNE CARBON EB03","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe EB03 cuvée is a 2013 vintage, which has initial scents of citrus, followed by aromas of spring flowers, then a growing intensity toward yellow citrus, toasty notes and aromatic herbs. On the palate it provides an initial intensity, followed by a creamier more velvety texture. The finish reveals hints of acidity. The grape variety is 100% Chardonnay Grand Cru, which will enhance a delicate recipe such as a scallop ceviche, a red tuna sashimi or a filet of Saint-Pierre with citrus fruits. The 750ml bottle is wrapped with Carbon Fiber. Packaging includes luxury box and free delivery all over Europe.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344151814491,"sku":"EB03","price":320.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/c9_786d28de-c6c0-48cd-9b82-be1dbbf2e496.jpg?v=1742416345"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-chiron-scale-model-1-24-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez CHIRON SCALE MODEL 1:24 BLUE","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA highly detailed 1:24 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Bolide in blue (approx. 14cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344152895835,"sku":"M31514","price":28.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-chiron-diecast-model-blue-black-m15_1.jpg?v=1764245164"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-divo-scale-model-1-24-remote-control","title":"Datum Dahleez DIVO SCALE MODEL 1:24 REMOTE CONTROL","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA highly detailed 1:24 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Divo in grey (approx. 14cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344156369243,"sku":"M81515","price":35.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/m23_21